itle><![CDATA[Watch: Drones take to Delhi skies ahead of CJP protest against CEC Gyanesh Kumar]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/watch-drones-take-to-delhi-skies-ahead-of-cjp-protest-against-cec-gyanesh-kumar/articleshow/134846792.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134846792.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[In anticipation of the Cockroach Janta Party's protest in central Delhi, drones and a heavy police presence have been mobilized. The protest calls for the resignation of Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar due to alleged electoral roll discrepancies. Despite the police denying permission, organizers are determined to continue, leading to major disruptions in public transport. Comprehensive security measures are being implemented, including various checkpoints and surveillance systems to ensure safety.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/watch-drones-take-to-delhi-skies-ahead-of-cjp-protest-against-cec-gyanesh-kumar/articleshow/134846792.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/watch-drones-take-to-delhi-skies-ahead-of-cjp-protest-against-cec-gyanesh-kumar/articleshow/134846792.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-10T08:59:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aryan Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134846803,imgsize-7951721.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['New Delhi modelled after new J&amp;K': Omar Abdullah on internet curbs for CJP protest]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/new-delhi-modelled-after-new-jk-omar-abdullah-on-internet-curbs-for-cjp-protest/articleshow/134846660.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134846660.c